      },
      "required": [
        "product_type_id",
        "subAccounts",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "method": "GET",
    "name": "bandwidth_monitoring_list",
    "path": "/externalapi/bandwidth/monitoringList",
    "readOnly": true,
    "title": "带宽监控列表",
  },
  {
    "description": "查询时长类产品可购买的带宽档位与价格。price 是每 IP 每天、还没乘档位折扣的价格，month_price 是它的 30 倍；实际扣费以下单为准。",
